# Local dev secrets live in .dev.vars (wrangler dev reads it; not committed). Production: `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
#   APP_BASE_URL          http://localhost:5174 in .dev.vars; production value is in wrangler.jsonc
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET   Google OAuth web client (Google Cloud → Auth Platform → Clients)
#   KEY_SECRET            32 random bytes, base64 (openssl rand -base64 32): encrypts users' Gemini keys at rest
#   GROQ_API_KEY          shared, free: second AI provider for subtitles / help / review (https://console.groq.com/keys)
#   GEMINI_API_KEY        optional: the app's own key, used only for SPONSORED_EMAILS
#   SPONSORED_EMAILS      optional, comma-separated: accounts that use GEMINI_API_KEY instead of their own key
#
# dev/probe-*.mjs scripts read GEMINI_API_KEY from .env.local:
GEMINI_API_KEY=
